{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And he entreated YHWH.</b> He girded himself in prayer. And so if one were to say וַיַּעְתִּיר — it could have said [simply] וַיִּתְפַּלֵּל, which would mean 'and he multiplied in prayer.' But when it uses the hif'il form, it means 'and he multiplied to pray.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:09.461173907Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}